  "content": {
    "en_us": "Coal tar creosote can be made by coking any form of coal or lignite in a [[combination oven|Combination Oven]]. It is primarily [[fractioned|Fractioning Tower]] for [[coal oil|Coal Oil]] and [[bitumen|Bitumen]].",
